""SELECT s0.\"ServiceRecordID\", s0.\"BookingID\", s0.\"CustomerID\", s0.\"IsDeleted\", s0.\"MechanicId\", s0.\"ServiceID\", s0.\"Status\", c.\"CustomerID\", c.\"Email\", c.\"Name\", c.\"Phone\", c.\"Status\", m.\"MechanicId\", m.\"Email\", m.\"Name\", m.\"Phone\", m.\"Status\", s1.\"ServiceID\", s1.\"Description\", s1.\"IsDeleted\", s1.\"VehicleID\", v.\"VehicleID\", s4.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\", s4.\"ServicesServiceID\", s4.\"CategoryID\", s4.\"Amount\", s4.\"Name\", s4.\"Status\", v.\"IsDeleted\", v.\"VechicleManufacturer\", v.\"VehicleModel\", v.\"VehicleNo\", v.\"VehicleType\"
FROM (
    SELECT s.\"ServiceRecordID\", s.\"BookingID\", s.\"CustomerID\", s.\"IsDeleted\", s.\"MechanicId\", s.\"ServiceID\", s.\"Status\"
    FROM \"serviceRecords\" AS s
    WHERE NOT (s.\"IsDeleted\")
    LIMIT @__p_1 OFFSET @__p_0
) AS s0
INNER JOIN \"Customers\" AS c ON s0.\"CustomerID\" = c.\"CustomerID\"
INNER JOIN \"Mechanics\" AS m ON s0.\"MechanicId\" = m.\"MechanicId\"
INNER JOIN \"Services\" AS s1 ON s0.\"ServiceID\" = s1.\"ServiceID\"
INNER JOIN \"Vehicles\" AS v ON s1.\"VehicleID\" = v.\"VehicleID\"
LEFT JOIN (
    SELECT s2.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\", s2.\"ServicesServiceID\", s3.\"CategoryID\", s3.\"Amount\", s3.\"Name\", s3.\"Status\"
    FROM \"ServiceServiceCategory\" AS s2
    INNER JOIN \"ServiceCategories\" AS s3 ON s2.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\" = s3.\"CategoryID\"
) AS s4 ON s1.\"ServiceID\" = s4.\"ServicesServiceID\"
ORDER BY s0.\"ServiceRecordID\", c.\"CustomerID\", m.\"MechanicId\", s1.\"ServiceID\", v.\"VehicleID\", s4.\"ServiceCategoriesCategoryID\", s4.\"ServicesServiceID\""
